Why this fixes most cases

We removed any wrong forced overlay and let auto-detect identify the sensor.

If your new camera is V3 (IMX708), forcing imx219 will always fail.

Group perms + reboot ensure userspace can access the camera.

Reseating the ribbon fixes the #1 hardware cause.

If you paste the outputs from step 4 when it fails, I’ll tell you the exact next command to run.

GPIO → python3-rpi.gpio + group permissions

TFLite Runtime → correct wheel for Python 3.11 + aarch64

Overlay config → forces IMX219 detection even if auto-detect fails

Groups → video, render, input, gpio so no sudo needed
